UPDATE `npc_text` SET `text0_0` = '暴风城两家最受欢迎的旅店分别坐落在贸易区和矮人区:镶金玫瑰和黄金酒桶。' WHERE `ID` = 16605 AND `text0_0` = 'Stormwind\'s two most popular inns are located in the Trade and Dwarven Districts: The Gilded Rose and The Golden Keg.';
UPDATE `npc_text` SET `text0_0` = '黄金酒桶位於矮人区的北侧，就在喷泉旁边。' WHERE `ID` = 16606 AND `text0_0` = 'The Golden Keg is in the northen part of the Dwarven District, right by the fountain.';
UPDATE `npc_text` SET `text0_0` = '暴风城有许多有趣的景点，从矿道地铁到暴风要塞，应有尽有。$B$B你想要去哪里?' WHERE `ID` = 16607 AND `text0_0` = 'Stormwind has many points of interest, from the Deeprun Tram to Stormwind Keep.$B$BWhat were you looking for?';
UPDATE `npc_text` SET `text0_0` = '旧城区和矮人区都有兽栏管理员。' WHERE `ID` = 16608 AND `text0_0` = 'There are stable masters in both Old Town and the Dwarven District.';
UPDATE `npc_text` SET `text0_0` = '卡利在暴风城的最东边，穿过旧城区後面的门口就能看到他。' WHERE `ID` = 16609 AND `text0_0` = 'Byron Oakhorn can be found in earternmost Stormwind, through the gates at the back of Old Town.';
UPDATE `npc_text` SET `text0_0` = '矮人区和旧城区的指挥所里头都有猎人训练师。' WHERE `ID` = 16617 AND `text0_0` = 'There are hunters training in Old Town\'s Command Center as well as in the Dwarven District.';
UPDATE `npc_text` SET `text0_0` = '旧城区的东门外面经常会有些猎人在那边。' WHERE `ID` = 16618 AND `text0_0` = 'You can always find a handful of hunters just outside Old Town\'s east gate.';
UPDATE `npc_text` SET `text0_0` = '花园...?$B$B花园已经毁了，你没听说吗?巨龙死亡之翼在飞过暴风城上空的时候把那里给毁了。$B$B坦白讲，不晓得他为什么没有把整座城都给毁了，但是我们全都很感谢圣光，还好他没有这么做。' WHERE `ID` = 16619 AND `text0_0` = 'The Park...?$B$BIt\'s in ruins. Haven\'t you heard? The great dragon Deathwing soared over Stormwind and destroyed it in passing.$B$BNot sure why he didn\'t level everything, honestly, but we all thank the Light he didn\'t.';
UPDATE `npc_text` SET `text0_0` = '要塞坐落在暴风城北。$B$B只要沿着运河往北走，你就会经过一座吊桥...通往要塞的中庭。' WHERE `ID` = 16620 AND `text0_0` = 'The keep is in northren Stormwind.$B$BJust follow the canals north and you\'ll eventually come across a drawbridge... that leads into the keep\'s courtyard.';
UPDATE `npc_text` SET `text0_0` = '监狱?为什么你会想要去那里?它位在暴风城的正中间，就在法师区的东北边。$B$B假如你真的想去那里的话，请多加小心，我有听到暴动的消息。' WHERE `ID` = 16621 AND `text0_0` = 'The prison? Why would you want to go there? It\'s in the center of the city, just northeast of the Mage Quarter.$B$BIf you\'re truly going there, be careful. I\'ve heard news of riots.';
UPDATE `npc_text` SET `text0_0` = '我们已陆陆续续接到了不少的报告，说有元素在艾泽拉斯各地骚动。而且我们的情报来源还指出，它们并非全是自然发生的现象，只是我们尚未找出明确的成因。我们是有一些理论，但依旧缺乏明确的答案。$B$B当你在外旅行冒险的时候，请睁大眼睛注意是否有任何可疑的元素活动。假如你发现了任何值得关注的消息，请告知陶土议会的特使。我们在各大主城都有派驻代表。$B$B请你睁大眼睛，动乱正在酝酿。' WHERE `ID` = 16624 AND `text0_0` = 'We\'ve been hearing reports of elemental disturbances around Azeroth for some time now. Our sources indicate that the phenomenon is not entirely natural, but we haven\'t quite been able to determine the source. We have some theories though, but nothing concrete.$B$BKeep your eye out for any suspicious elemental activity as you walk around.  If you find anything worthwhile, please let an Earthen Ring Emissary know. You can find us in any capital city.$B$BBe careful out there.  Trouble is brewing.';
UPDATE `npc_text` SET `text0_0` = '丹门家族珠宝店，位於北贸易区和运河之间，那应该有你想要的东西。' WHERE `ID` = 16627 AND `text0_0` = 'Denman Family Jewelers, between the northern Trade District and The Canals, should have everything you\'re looking for.';
UPDATE `npc_text` SET `text0_0` = '哈里逊·琼斯如果没有出去进行调查，他都会在暴风要塞的皇家图书馆里教授考古学。' WHERE `ID` = 16628 AND `text0_0` = 'Harrison Jones teaches Archaeology in Stormwind Keep\'s Royal Library when not out in the field.';
UPDATE `npc_text` SET `text0_0` = '专业技能商人一定能在相应的训练师附近找到。其他的商人则散布於暴风城各个角落。$B$B你在找的是什么?' WHERE `ID` = 16629 AND `text0_0` = 'Profession vendors can always be found near their respective trainers. Other sorts of vendors are scattered throughout Stormwind.$B$BWhat were you looking for?';
UPDATE `npc_text` SET `text0_0` = '勇士大厅位於旧城区东南边的尽头。$B$B荣誉纹章与征服点数军需官都在里头。' WHERE `ID` = 16630 AND `text0_0` = 'The Champions\' Hall is located in the southeastern end of Old Town.$B$BThe Honor and Conquest quartermasters can be found there.';
UPDATE `npc_text` SET `text0_0` = '在指挥所里，就在旧城区东南门的外面，军需官就在那边。' WHERE `ID` = 16631 AND `text0_0` = 'In the Command Center, just outside of Old Town\'s southeast gates, you\'ll find the quartermasters.';
UPDATE `npc_text` SET `text0_0` = '旧城区的东南城门外就有一座马厩，骑术训练师和马匹饲养师都在那里。' WHERE `ID` = 16632 AND `text0_0` = 'There are stables just beyond Old Town\'s southeast gates. You can find a riding trainer and a horse breeder there.';
UPDATE `npc_text` SET `text0_0` = '你知道狮鹫兽栖息处其实是在贸易区吗?就在飞行管理员那里。$B$B有两位蛮锤氏族的矮人在那边饲养和贩卖狮鹫兽，甚至还能训练你该怎样驾驭牠们。' WHERE `ID` = 16634 AND `text0_0` = 'Do you know of the Gryphon Roost off the Trade District, where the Flight Master may be found?$B$BA pair of Wildhammer dwarves raises and sells gryphons there, and can even train you to ride the beasts.';
UPDATE `npc_text` SET `text0_0` = '你好像很累的样子。出什么差错了吗?' WHERE `ID` = 16635 AND `text0_0` = 'You look exhausted. Is something wrong?';
